      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 19:30 to 22:00 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 22:07 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 22:30 I was at home.",
      "time": 32846,
      "topics": [
