      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Crooked Pike, from about 18:00 to 22:00 on Day 23, I saw Greta, Jonas, Lena, Margaret, Marta, Nora, Oskar, Selma and Vera, coming and going; Greta, Lena, Oskar and Vera were the worse for drink.",
