      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 23: from about 19:30 to 20:00 I was at home; around 20:06 I passed through Mill Road; around 20:08 I passed through the square; from about 20:15 to 22:15 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 22:14 I passed through the square; around 22:16 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 22:30 I was at home.",
