      "text": "At the Crooked Pike, from about 19:00 to 22:00 on Day 23, I saw Greta, Ida, Jonas, Lena, Margaret, Marta, Oskar, Selma and Vera, coming and going; Greta, Ida, Lena and Oskar were the worse for drink.",
