      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Crooked Pike, from about 18:00 to 22:00 on Day 23, I saw Greta, Ida, Jonas, Lena, Margaret, Marta, Nora, Selma and Vera, coming and going; Ida, Lena and Vera were the worse for drink.",
